🚀 Week 6 – Day 1 Zero-Shot, One-Shot & Few-Shot Prompting 🎯🤖

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🧠 Introduction

Prompting is a key technique used with LLMs like GPT-4.

👉 Different prompting styles help models:

✔ Understand tasks better
✔ Improve accuracy
✔ Generate structured outputs

---

🔹 What is Prompting?

```text id="prompt_def2"
Giving instructions or examples to an AI model to guide its response
```

---

📊 Types of Prompting

1️⃣ Zero-Shot Prompting
2️⃣ One-Shot Prompting
3️⃣ Few-Shot Prompting

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚡ 1. Zero-Shot Prompting

---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Definition

```text id="zero_def"
No examples are provided to the model
```

---

📌 Example

```text id="zero_ex"
Translate "Good morning" to French
```

---

🎯 When to Use

✔ Simple tasks
✔ Well-known problems
✔ Quick responses

---

⚠️ Limitation

❌ May give less accurate results
❌ Model may misunderstand task

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚡ 2. One-Shot Prompting

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Definition

```text id="one_def"
Provide one example to guide the model
```

---

📌 Example

```text id="one_ex"
English: Hello → French: Bonjour  
English: Good night →
```

---

🎯 When to Use

✔ Slightly complex tasks
✔ Need guidance
✔ Improve accuracy over zero-shot

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

⚡ 3. Few-Shot Prompting

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

🔹 Definition

```text id="few_def"
Provide multiple examples to guide the model
```

---

📌 Example

```text id="few_ex"
English: Hello → French: Bonjour  
English: Thank you → French: Merci  
English: Good night →
```

---

🎯 When to Use

✔ Complex tasks
✔ Structured output needed
✔ Higher accuracy required

---

📊 Comparison

| Feature    | Zero-Shot   | One-Shot     | Few-Shot      |
| ---------- | ----------- | ------------ | ------------- |
| Examples   | 0           | 1            | Multiple      |
| Accuracy   | Low         | Medium       | High          |
| Complexity | Simple      | Moderate     | Complex       |
| Use Case   | Quick tasks | Guided tasks | Complex tasks |

---

🧠 Key Insight

```text id="insight"
More examples → Better understanding → Better output
```

---

🔧 Best Practices

✔ Start with zero-shot
✔ Add examples if needed
✔ Use few-shot for complex tasks
✔ Keep examples clear and relevant

---

🚀 Real-World Applications

✔ Chatbots
✔ Translation systems
✔ Data extraction
✔ Code generation
✔ RAG pipelines

---

⚠️ Common Mistakes

❌ Too many irrelevant examples
❌ Poor formatting
❌ Confusing instructions

---

🧠 Example (Advanced Few-Shot)

```text id="adv_ex"
Input: 2 + 2 → Output: 4  
Input: 3 + 5 → Output: 8  
Input: 7 + 6 →
```

-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

📚 Key Takeaways

✔ Zero-shot uses no examples
✔ One-shot uses one example
✔ Few-shot uses multiple examples
✔ More examples improve accuracy
✔ Essential technique in prompt engineering

